    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "增進攀岩運動之技能與常識、培養運動精神與團隊精神、養成正確運動觀念與休閒習慣",
      "describe_en": "To promote skill of the general knowledge of the rock climbing. Taise movement spirit and the team spirit. Fosters the correct exercise idea and the leisure habbit"
